Kab-ntawv thaum-tuaj: ['html'] ua: { <- (
		tus-kheej
		hloov: ['&'] nrog: ['&amp;'],
		hloov: ['<'] nrog: ['&lt;'],
		hloov: ['>'] nrog: ['&gt;'],
		hloov: ['"'] nrog: ['&quot;']
	).
}.

>> list := Daim-teev tshiab.

['Verbatim Syntax'] cov-tus-ntawv txhua: { :lej :letter
	list ; ((['<li>#Number:Letter</li>']) Number: (lej), Letter: letter).
}.

Tawm list.





>> template := ['
<html>
<body>
<p>Hello this is a test!</p>
<p>The string \‘Verbatim Syntax\’ has: 15 code points...</p>
<ul>
[list]
</ul>
</body> 
</html>
'] [list]: (list muab-sib-txuas: ['↵']).

Tawm sau-ntawv: template.

